              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_structure_event",
            "content": "In the third quarter of 2023, we entered into a $3,000 five-year revolving credit agreement expiring in August 2028 and a $800 364-day revolving credit agreement expiring in August 2024.",
            "entity_name": "BA Q3 2023 $3.0B Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalStructureEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note_reference": "Note 15",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_structure_event",
            "content": "In the third quarter of 2023, we entered into a $3,000 five-year revolving credit agreement expiring in August 2028 and a $800 364-day revolving credit agreement expiring in August 2024. The 364-day credit facility has a one-year term out option which allows us to extend the maturity of any borrowings until August 2025.",
            "entity_name": "BA Q3 2023 $800M 364-Day Revolving Credit Agreement",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalStructureEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
